w(";\n// NOTE: no SUPPORTED_BY_CHUNK from A1 into the corrected text version: A1 is SUPPORTED_BY L1 only; whether a re-anchored locator\n// joins an assertion's support is a W00 rule (W20-SR-06). The path chunk <- L2 -REANCHORS-> L1 <- A1 is the answer route.\n")
